    "detailed_description": "Embark on an &quot;<i><strong>epic</strong></i>&quot; adventure in a 2.5D topdown perspective game where you can shape the world to your liking. Explore the vast cave systems and conquer dangerous biomes as you gather materials and craft powerful tools to aid you in your quest. With a dynamic tier system, you'll be able to break harder blocks and conquer more challenging enemies. But be warned, the cave is filled with deadly creatures and giant bosses that stand in your way.<br><br>The fate of a magical tree rests in your hands as it is under siege by the enemy biomes. Your ultimate goal is to heal the tree and secure its safety. Along the way, you'll have the opportunity to fish, build, ride in a minecart, wire up some lights and farm crops to aid in your journey. Can you rise to the challenge and become the &quot;<i><strong>epic</strong></i>&quot; hero the cave needs? Find out in this survival game. About a cave.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300950/extras/b1e0aea00bdba1977d0bba47fc6ed97f.avif?t=1751357553\" /></span><br><br>current dev status:<br>total lines of code: <u><strong>162,170</strong></u> &lt;&lt; wow cool! good job man! pats on back !!<br>I eat ambitious for breakfast.<br>want to talk to flxp? email me here: <a href=\"mailto:talktoflxp@gmail.com\">talktoflxp@gmail.com</a>",
